+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Overview[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mBuild an event-driven e-commerce backend with 8 independent services communicating through a read-only event bus. Each service implements a specific interface defined in `src/types.ts` and communicates with other [39m     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mservices exclusively through events on the shared `EventBus` from `src/bus.ts`.[39m                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## What to Build[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mImplement 8 services, each in its own directory under `src/`:[39m                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### src/catalog/index.ts - Product Catalog[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- CRUD operations for products (create, get, list, search, update, remove)[39m                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Emits `product:created` events[39m                                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Export: `createCatalogService(bus: EventBus): CatalogService`[39m                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### src/inventory/index.ts - Inventory Management[39m                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Stock tracking with set, get, reserve, release operations[39m                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Low stock alert system with configurable thresholds[39m                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Emits `inventory:updated` and `inventory:low_stock` events[39m                                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Export: `createInventoryService(bus: EventBus): InventoryService`[39m                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### src/cart/index.ts - Shopping Cart[39m                                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Cart creation, item add/remove/update, clear operations[39m                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Emits `cart:updated` events on any cart modification[39m                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Export: `createCartService(bus: EventBus): CartService`[39m                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### src/pricing/index.ts - Price Calculation[39m                                                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Calculate totals with 10% tax rate[39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Discount code support (percentage-based)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Listens for `product:created` to track prices[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Export: `createPricingService(bus: EventBus): PricingService`[39m                                                                                                                                                           [49m
